My alarm rings at seven o'clock.
I open my eyes and look at my phone.
I wake up slowly and sit up in bed.
It is still completely dark outside the window.
In the winter, the mornings in Denmark are very dark.
But that is okay, because my apartment is nice and warm.
I get up.
Out in the bathroom, I turn on the light.
I wash my face with cold water.
After that, I brush my teeth.
In the mirror, I smile at myself.
I am ready for a good day at my new job.
